		{"id":"f266915c9f59140d","type":"text","text":"|                |                     |                                                                                                        |                                                                            |     |       |\n| -------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ----- |\n| Name           | Type                | Effect                                                                                                 | Visuals                                                                    |     | Done? |\n| Kalasirios     | Common Soldier      |                                                                                                        | a spearman with a large wicker shield, wearing a bright tunic.             |     | Yes   |\n| Spear-Prince   | Rare Soldier        | On turn: Bolster all Throne cards 0/+1. Cast: grant 1 Command                                          | a nobleman wearing a tiara and a large necklace, issuing a command         |     | No    |\n| Command        | Buff                | Buff. When a card with Command is bolstered, it gains more stats equal to the stacks of Command.       |                                                                            |     | No    |\n| Guardmaster    | Upgrade             | On turn: gain 1 Armor.                                                                                 |                                                                            |     | Yes   |\n| Armor          | Buff                | For each stack, reduces damage taken by 1. One stack is lost when the creature with Armor is attacked. |                                                                            |     | Done  |\n| Distinguished  | Rare Soldier        | Weaponmaster                                                                                           | A soldier armed from head to toe with more weapons than they'll ever need. |     | No    |\n| Weaponmaster   | Keyword             | Can equip 2 items at once                                                                              |                                                                            |     | No    |\n| Ahati          | Common Scout        | Cast: for 2 mana, shoot 1 enemy.                                                                       | A slinger preparing to let loose.                                          |     | No    |\n| Dreige Acolyte | Rare Soldier Priest | An ally is attacked: corrode the attacker for half of the Acolyte’s attack.                            | A priest fully dressed in cold-iron armor, dancing among flames.           |     | No    |\n| Huntsman       | Common Scout        | Cast: inflict Hunted. Kills: Gains +1/0.                                                               | A hunter dressed in furs, stalking, holding a spear and a sling            |     | No    |\n| Immortal       | Rare Soldier        | Arrives: gains 1 Command. Survives: is healed.                                                         | A masked figure wielding two scimitars.                                    |     | No    |","x":-620,"y":-240,"width":1240,"height":660},
